[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0251","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0251.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0593","title":"Anaconda Partners Clipper 3.3 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Anaconda Partners Clipper 3.3 及更早版本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在 template 参数中传入 '..' (点点) 序列进行目录遍历攻击，读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞源于对用户输入的 template 参数缺乏路径遍历过滤，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，仅需构造包含 '../' 序列的恶意请求即可读取服务器敏感文件（如 /etc/passwd、配置文件等），CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:N/A:N），影响 Anaconda Clipper 3.3 及更早版本，攻击条件为网络可达且无需认证，利用方式为构造包含目录遍历序列的 HTTP 请求发送至目标服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0593"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:35Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到Anaconda Partners Clipper的较新版本或可使用安全补丁。如果无法立即升级，可在web服务器层面配置URL参数验证（仅允许包含字母、数字和下划线的模板名称），并限制参数长度，防止包含路径遍历字符串的恶意请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://anacondapartners.com/cgi-local/apexec.pl?template=ap_releasenotestemplate.html&f1=ap_af_updates_menu&f2=ap_af_releasenotes_clip","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-03/0395.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2512","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6286","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20714","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0593.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0593.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0593","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0593.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0593.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pfcp-38f2-6hrr/GHSA-pfcp-38f2-6hrr.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/A/anacondaclip.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0593.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--29dcf0cb-9efe-4246-b4a6-f4da0bb635af.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0251.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0249","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0249.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0584","title":"Alt-N MDaemon 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Alt-N MDaemon 3.5.6/5.0.7/6.x 版本的 IMAP 服务存在拒绝服务漏洞，本地用户可通过发送超长的 SELECT 或 EXAMINE 命令导致 IMAP 服务挂起，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞源于 IMAP 服务未正确验证命令参数长度，导致处理超长命令时服务挂起。影响 MDaemon 3.5.6、5.0.7 及 6.x 版本，CVSS 评分 2.1（本地访问、低复杂度、无需认证、部分可用性影响）。攻击者需具备本地账户权限，通过发送超长 IMAP 命令即可触发拒绝服务。ExploitDB (EDB-20696) 及多个 GitHub 仓库均有公开 PoC 验证代码。Alt-N Technologies 已在后续版本中修复此漏洞，建议升级至最新版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0584"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:34Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Alt-N MDaemon 至 6.0.7 或更高版本（官方已修复该 IMAP DoS 漏洞），下载地址：https://www.altn.com/Downloads/MDaemon/。若暂时无法升级，请在防火墙层面限制 IMAP 端口（143/993）仅允许受信任内网 IP 访问，并在本地策略中限制非管理员用户执行 IMAP 命令，同时监控 IMAP 服务进程是否因长 SELECT/EXAMINE 命令挂起，必要时重启 MDaemon IMAP 服务作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-03/0365.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2508","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6279","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20696","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0584.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/b